e>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-04 13:18:25 +08:00\">23h 42m ago via iPhone</span><span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\">19</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>2</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>都不是，是会打包你源码仓库上传的那个</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255304\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/52e6/5864/442967_normal.png?m=1571234314\" alt=\"PopRain\" data-uid=\"442967\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>5</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>加入 GLM 5.3 , GLM 5.3 flash 比较一下？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255328\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a3c8/786f/669233_normal.png?m=1779423825\" alt=\"x4gz\" data-uid=\"669233\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>6</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>只要不许愿 我感觉都差不多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255340\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8290/547b/290004_normal.png?m=1709533014\" alt=\"tyit\" data-uid=\"290004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/tyit\">tyit</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-04 13:37:07 +08:00\">23h 23m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>7</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>Kimi 3.1 Pro</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255536\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ccf8efdc32fc51f48a28eabed0225c16?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Configuration\" data-uid=\"460366\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>11</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div><p>感觉 deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 比 GLM 5.3 强一些，但实际上又没 GLM 5.3 稳当</p><p>Kimi 3.1 目前可能是最强的，但是其超大参数导致价格也很高，入不了主流</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255546\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4bf6/85f7/345630_normal.png?m=1789109796\" alt=\"lmmlwen\" data-uid=\"345630\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>12</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>真没那么多时间去浪费，看来国内程序员还是太闲了，天天试国产模型，即使是最保守的码农，也是直接选择 cursor</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255570\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b69b802f2e87e9871a25251316530e7c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"langzi1949\" data-uid=\"829573\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>13</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>Deepseek-v4.1-flash 我觉得就不错，我用过 kimi 3,但是 token 消耗太狠了，现在我主力还是 deepseek</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255584\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f722477c28091cffee602142d29fee78?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Miaosful\" data-uid=\"626325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>14</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>不考虑性价比还是 kimi ，考虑价格因素我选 ds</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255600\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cfd5/a9c8/448693_normal.png?m=1787116927\" alt=\"reoah2\" data-uid=\"448693\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>15</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>我太菜了，感觉不出来，都摸不到 AI 的边界</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255631\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a95c/4050/14375_normal.png?m=1754922138\" alt=\"idblife\" data-uid=\"14375\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>16</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>不要考虑太多，直接上 opus5.5</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255731\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9ba7efd4a78472ab4804a31a76c7b277?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nonez\" data-uid=\"668651\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>19</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>一直用 deepseek,陆陆续续花了百把块。感觉够用就行，不顺手就换，不用整军备竞赛似的研究每个模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255744\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9b93dd7a4a2d10562ba4e1ef977bafc3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"RichardPlus\" data-uid=\"579897\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>20</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>当然是我们的'又快又快'模型啦, 但是别许愿, 认真写 prompt</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255805\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da7d/fb92/754606_normal.png?m=1789721027\" alt=\"mathiashu4\" data-uid=\"754606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>22</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>国模 GLM <br>海外 OPUS5.5<br>Astra 越用越失望</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255931\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4ee2/21b4/406045_normal.png?m=1658197092\" alt=\"0xnycth\" data-uid=\"406045\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>24</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>性价比这块 ds 太强了，但是问的是不考虑价格，那估计是 GLM 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18255933\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/228e/9063/91848_normal.png?m=1639460129\" alt=\"hsir\" data-uid=\"91848\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>25</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>GLM 5.3 &gt; Kimi 3.1 Pro &gt; DS V4.1</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256004\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/610d06995a2af0fabedb935a420b532b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dwhh\" data-uid=\"579717\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>27</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>GLM 的问题是除了编程，其它的很差；编的文档不是人话，但是看在他网页版输出文档的份上，确实膜拜。<br>国模感觉画图都有点问题，字与图会重叠。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256174\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4654caa89f60d910fa6597bcf00f4f1b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"HTravel\" data-uid=\"688168\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>28</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>国模用下来都还行吧，只要需求明确，基本上都能独自完成。唯一不满的是上下文还是太短，我个人的项目，居然首轮都能将 1M 打满被压缩</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256185\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/976332446f34616465d49f797b896115?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"javen73\" data-uid=\"256191\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>29</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>GLM 和 DS 都好用，编程优先 GLM</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256284\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a3da/4398/139883_normal.png?m=1776846604\" alt=\"dz5362\" data-uid=\"139883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>32</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>DS V4.1 太便宜了，而且我都是输出一些前端交互页面，写的飞快，舍得蹬</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256300\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b15/0d66/525806_normal.png?m=1715683975\" alt=\"cvooc\" data-uid=\"525806\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>33</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>zcode 接 d4.1f 顺手是真顺手, 太顺手了.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256319\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/02e7db4f7f475f0594e648d41570f2a0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"msy45\" data-uid=\"486307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>34</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>只考虑质量 肯定是 Kimi 3.1 Pro</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256364\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/10979cb294c39e8c543f989221af697c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"0n2ynu\" data-uid=\"614919\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>35</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>glm 是不是拿了一堆阿里的文档来训练？说的全是黑话，一套一套的，看得非常头疼</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256508\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/18e0428406409ba21f3ba7a2ace3f6b0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"victorc\" data-uid=\"579450\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>36</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>glm5.3-flash<br>鼓吹用海外模型的，都是高风险，如果是代码有核心知识产权 （比如特殊的算法，做得好的量化策略），都要用私有部署的大模型， 推理都是明文的，等同于上传代码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256534\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8d9381864d818387af1057850a21a083?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"v2NPC\" data-uid=\"517931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>37</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>体感 glm5.3 最强，但是太慢了，最近都用 ds-4.1</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256576\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3c06/f7fd/695146_normal.png?m=1786592794\" alt=\"crazykun\" data-uid=\"695146\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>40</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>glm 最强，不过今天新出的 hy4,体感也不错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/141f86b5cead0224ebc0365353521a26?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"paopjian\" data-uid=\"268237\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>41</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>4.1flash 用的很开心, 速度很可以<br>GLM5.3 用的套餐, 送了一堆重置用不完, 感觉 5.3 很多时候经常不说人话, 速度也比较慢, 5.3flash 快倒是快, 但和 4.1f 一样笨了点</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256834\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8f1579d7553eca43d05972495847751a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jinsongzhaocn\" data-uid=\"460727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>44</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lmmlwen\">lmmlwen</a> 有公司给的资源，不用翻墙就用的，谁还会去尝试各种模型，我和邻居就是如此，他在家直连公司，随便使用 Claude 全部模型，而我还要翻墙，断网，卡顿，还不如国外的查方案，国产的搞生产。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256915\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7cd8/3a90/469789_normal.png?m=1715413529\" alt=\"SimonYeh\" data-uid=\"469789\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>46</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>综合 GLM5.3 （不带 flash ），前端 Kimi K3</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257173\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><